UID:EdmVCfkuBk7zQBUiBHE_1
SUMMARY:Docent Recruitment Open House & Breakfast
DTSTAMP:20260713T123515Z
DTSTART:20260820T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:FreeRegistration encouraged\; walk-in participants welcomeAges 
	21+ \n\n\n\nCalling all nature lovers! We are looking to grow our team of 
	Arboretum Docents and would like to invite you to learn more at this infor
	mational breakfast. Docents are volunteers who are specially trained to en
	gage visitors of all ages and backgrounds in active explorations of our tr
	ails and Discovery Room. We are currently recruiting individuals for our u
	pcoming docent trainings to prepare for fall programs! \n\n\n\n\nRSVP Onli
	ne\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nConcerned that you know very little about natural hist
	ory\, native flora/fauna\, or the Arboretum in general? Not to worry! Doce
	nt training is comprehensive and includes extensive content-based classes 
	as well as training on effective touring techniques. \n\n\n\nIf you are in
	terested in helping us teach our visitors about nature and all it has to o
	ffer\, we encourage you to attend!\n\nhttps://houstonarboretum.org/event/d
	ocent-recruitment-open-house-breakfast/\n\nFrom Houston Arboretum & Nature
	 Center
URL:https://houstonarboretum.org/event/docent-recruitment-open-house-breakf
	ast/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-arboretum
CATEGORIES:Houston Arboretum & Nature Center
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
